      en: ["The river flows into the Atlantic Ocean at Matura Bay on the east coast.", "It is the primary feeder for the Hollis Dam, completed in 1936.", "The Cumaca Cave along its banks is a primary nesting site for Oilbirds.", "The surrounding Northern Range peaks reach heights of over 500 meters.", "The river system supports over 50 species of freshwater fish and crustaceans.", "Average annual rainfall in this catchment area is approximately 2,800 mm."],
