      en: ["The island covers an area of approximately 900 acres (3.6 km²).", "The highest point, Morne Cabrite, rises 251 meters above sea level.", "The leper colony operated for 62 years before closing in 1984.", "It is located approximately 7 miles from the Venezuelan mainland.", "The island contains a natural inland salt pond near the Sanders Bay.", "Historical ruins include a 1920s-era cinema for the hospital staff."],
