      en: ["Fishing Pond is formally designated as an Environmentally Sensitive Area (ESA).", "The beach is one of the top nesting sites globally for Leatherback Turtles.", "The turtle nesting season typically runs from March to August each year.", "The area has a long history of rice farming, which continues on a small scale.", "It is located in the Sangre Grande region on Trinidad's eastern Atlantic coast.", "The wetlands are home to rare bird species, including the West Indian Whistling-Duck."],
